    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Plans and preparations",
     "texto": [
      "The simple future of many perfective verbs expresses an action that will be completed: **odwiedzę**, **zarezerwuję**, **wrócimy**.",
      "The compound future with the infinitive focuses on the activity: **będę odpoczywać**. Both forms can be translated into English with «will»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
